    "voice": "produce_events/600100107/6001001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃……",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001070020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あの、プロデューサーさん\r\n今だからこそ、お礼を言わせてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100107/6001001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001070030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "何もできなかった私を……アイドルとして、\r\nここまで成長させてくれて、ありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100107/6001001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001070040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "最後に負けちゃいましたけど……ここまで来れたのは、\r\nプロデューサーさんが支えてくれたおかげですっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100107/6001001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……真乃は、もう満足したのか？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001070050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……いえ、まだまだずっとアイドルを続けたいです\r\nステージでファンのみなさんにいろんな思いを届けたい",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100107/6001001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001070060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私、最初はここまで来れただけで満足だったのに……\r\n今はもっと先へと羽ばたいていきたいと思っています",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100107/6001001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃がそう言ってくれてうれしいよ\r\nこれからも最高のアイドルを目指して、二人で頑張ろうな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
